    you drop, taking as many of the Aliens with you as can. Good luck, and Godspeed
    Pilot.


    [WASD/Arrows] - Move Ship

    [Left Ctrl / Ctrl] - Shoot

    [Space]
    - Eagle Jump

    [Esc/ P] - Pause Game'
